# Unlocking a Myth: DarkKnight (jeuno 109): Lower Jeuno's Zalsuhm (no script; default 10085), the template
# UnlockingAMyth for xi.job.DRK (8). A level 75 DRK with the DeathSickle (its Vigil weapon, Main slot) at 250 weapon
# skill points. Available: a trade: no trade handler; not wearing it: 10085; worn: 10086 (8), finished 0: nothing;
# 10086 again, finished 8: begun. Accepted: the cutscene 10087. (The worn weapon cannot be traded: #trade trades it
# unworn.) The other nineteen jobs' quests are silent (each check reads the main job).
lists LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrigger LowerJeuno/Zalsuhm/onTrade LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10086
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=-31.5,5.9,-117.5 job=DRK lvl=75
item DeathSickle wsp=250
login
trade Zalsuhm DeathSickle x1            # available: no trade handler; nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # not wearing the weapon: 10085
finish
equip DeathSickle Main                  # the Main slot
trigger Zalsuhm                         # wearing it: 10086 (8)
finish option=0                         # neither 53 nor 8: nothing
trigger Zalsuhm                         # 10086 (8)
finish option=8                         # begun
trigger Zalsuhm                         # accepted: the cutscene 10087
finish
